WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.962
Staff can now flag a member for attention, or suspend them, always with a reason.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.969
Each row that can be moderated has one action, and shows its note under the status.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.522
Moderate opens a dialog. Flag is chosen first, the milder step. A note is all it

00:00:21.522 --> 00:00:22.236
needs.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.054
A toast confirms it, and the list shows the member flagged, with the note.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:39.026
Suspend asks for more: the note, and a confirmation that their sessions will end.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.027
Leave something out, and the dialog names it before anything is sent.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.821
On the server, suspending ends every session in the same save, and sign-in is

00:00:56.821 --> 00:00:58.436
refused in both apps.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:07.271
Nobody moderates their own account, and only an Admin moderates staff. Each refusal

00:01:07.271 --> 00:01:08.651
has its own code.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.922
Every test failed first. Now they all pass.

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:19.888
Next, reinstating a member.

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.849
That's slice twenty-seven point one. Christian Fitness: a Christian community for

00:01:28.849 --> 00:01:30.705
health in body and spirit.
